/*!
\page page_stemctriggerdetector StEmcTriggerDetector

\brief EMC trigger detector data: BEMC/EEMC high-tower ADCs, patch sums, multi-level DSM outputs.

\section stemctriggerdetector_overview Overview
\c StEmcTriggerDetector stores electromagnetic calorimeter trigger data for the Barrel
EMC (BEMC) and Endcap EMC (EEMC).  High-tower and patch-sum ADC values feed the L0
trigger decision for selecting high-energy photons, electrons, and neutral pions.
Multi-level DSM output arrays allow offline inspection of the trigger logic chain.

\section stemctriggerdetector_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StEmcTriggerDetector
\endcode

\section stemctriggerdetector_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| unsigned char[300] | mHighTower | BEMC patch high-tower ADC |
| unsigned char[300] | mPatch | BEMC patch sum ADC |
| unsigned char[90] | mHighTowerEndcap | EEMC patch high-tower ADC |
| unsigned char[90] | mPatchEndcap | EEMC patch sum ADC |
| unsigned short[48] | mBemcLayer1 | BEMC DSM Layer-1 words |
| unsigned short[16] | mEemcLayer1 | EEMC DSM Layer-1 words |
| unsigned short[8] | mEmcLayer2 | Combined EMC DSM Layer-2 words |

\section stemctriggerdetector_methods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `unsigned int highTower(int i) const` | BEMC high-tower ADC patch i |
| `unsigned int patch(int i) const` | BEMC patch sum ADC patch i |
| `unsigned int highTowerEndcap(int i) const` | EEMC high-tower ADC patch i |
| `unsigned int patchEndcap(int i) const` | EEMC patch sum ADC patch i |
| `unsigned short bemcLayer1(int i) const` | BEMC Layer-1 DSM word i |
| `unsigned short eemcLayer1(int i) const` | EEMC Layer-1 DSM word i |
| `unsigned short emcLayer2(int i) const` | EMC Layer-2 DSM word i |

\section stemctriggerdetector_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEmcTriggerDetector& emc = event->triggerDetectorCollection()->emc();
for (int i = 0; i < 300; ++i)
    if (emc.highTower(i) > 15)
        cout << "High tower patch " << i << endl;
\endcode

\see \ref page_sttriggerdetectorcollection
*/
